type: software
title: "IMPaCT Synergy Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Python pipeline that computes the IMPaCT minimal-principle metrics (RAM, PDI,
  NAS, IIM, SRPI) and the composite Consciousness Index (CI) from EEG and fMRI
  data, with local and HPC (HLRS Hunter) execution modes.
